%% CARES - Entity Relationship Diagram (Mermaid erDiagram, Crow's Foot)
%% Source: server/src/infastructures/prisma/schema.prisma (PostgreSQL)
%% 57 tables, 70 foreign-key relationships
%% Paste into https://mermaid.live
%% Cardinality symbols:  ||  exactly one   |o  zero or one   o{  zero or many   |{  one or many
%% Parent side: || when the FK is NOT NULL (mandatory), |o when the FK is nullable (optional).
%% Child side:  o{ for 1:M, o| for 1:1 (FK column is UNIQUE).
%% M:N relationships are resolved through associative entities:
%%   Event M:N User via EventAttendance
%%   Conversation M:N User via ConversationParticipant
%%   CertificateTemplate M:N User via CertificateTemplateSignatory
%%   CertificateTemplate M:N Event via CertificateDeployment
%%   CertificateDeployment M:N User via IssuedCertificate
%%   Event M:N User via EvaluationResponse
